2d0b FINAL-v5: new ordinary real-stock headless Jupyter V4/shared-caller coupling; non-voting, no source change or main request.

Distinct from consumed portable V1 4-case qualification and offline 8-case fixture: new two documents/people, new driver, unique browser namespace/session, exact V4 package8fe7c2b7a955187939014aff33cf61ed01ea90e9 and caller52d6b295c68e6c175d25aa9f52a58936c341983f. Deterministic subject, actual model calls0; not a rich-model performance comparison. Own isolated loopback stock JupyterLab, autosave off, no outside writers or physical GUI.

Producer actual session93983 terminal exit0; healthy caller TASK_SUCCEEDED with execute+verify once. Journal-after-Save returns EXECUTION_INCOMPLETE, 2 known returned real adapter methods, input_dispatched=true, executeonce/no caller verification or resend. Separate literal-byte file observation confirms both intended role edits and unchanged sibling. Saved-only independent audit actualexit0 joins58 native commands/receipts, exactly2 Save-key attempts and2 inserttext, all native commands returned with actualchild0/unknown0. Browser close returned, authenticated shutdown200, launcher0, own Job empty without forced termination (150 processes; Job CPU10.375s, peak commit583528448B). Job scope excludes services/WMI/remote/physical input; no physical key-release proof or arbitrary-writer atomicity/current-main adoption claim. Adapter-returned completions are not a general native delivery/durability certificate.

First reader failed because producer source glob accidentally included redirected stdout.txt pinned empty; final print changed that output. First failure and first reader retained. Corrected only saved-data reader to exclude exact runtime stdout/stderr from source pins; all actual code/config/fixture pins unchanged. Actor not replayed. Original producer SOURCE_BEFORE/RESULT remain unchanged and contain this overinclusive pin; corrected interpretation below is explicit.

Review/adoption remains pending, no old votes reused. Private raw commands/token/response bodies remain local; evidence here is exact driver/reader/results and source pins, not a complete public native-raw reconstruction.

